================================================================================
External dependencies (not redistributed here)
================================================================================

Graph Powers requires two external plugins at runtime. Neither is vendored into this repository;
both are installed from their own distribution channels by the setup playbook in AGENT_SETUP.md,
and remain under their own licenses:

  superpowers   https://github.com/obra/superpowers          (MIT)
  impeccable    https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable        (Apache License 2.0)

Three further plugins are optional, and named where a command calls them:

  code-review   the bundled review skill invoked by /pr-review
  codex         the Codex rescue and result-handling skills invoked by /debug and /research
